{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"yaml-plus","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"YAML","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for YAML (.yaml .yml).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"yaml-plus","name":"YAML","extensions":[".yaml",".yml"],"grammar":"grammars/yaml-plus.json","filenames":[".clang-format",".gitlab-ci.yml"],"lineComment":"#"}],"snippets":[{"language":"YAML","path":"snippets/yaml-plus.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/yaml-plus.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^\\\\s*-?\\\\s*[A-Za-z0-9_.\\\\-\\\\/\\\"']+(?=\\\\s*:(?:\\\\s|$))\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"[&*][A-Za-z0-9_\\\\-]+\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^---|^\\\\.\\\\.\\\\.\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"![A-Za-z!]+\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"[|>][-+]?\\\\s*$\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|False|true|null|True|Null|yes|off|no|on|~)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/yaml-plus.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"GitHub Actions workflow\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"gha\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"name: ${1:CI}\",\n      \"on:\",\n      \"  push:\",\n      \"    branches: [main]\",\n      \"jobs:\",\n      \"  build:\",\n      \"    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\",\n      \"    steps:\",\n      \"      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\",\n      \"      - run: ${2:echo hello}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A GitHub Actions workflow\"\n  },\n  \"Docker Compose service\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"dcs\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:app}:\",\n      \"  image: ${2:nginx:alpine}\",\n      \"  ports:\",\n      \"    - \\\"${3:8080}:80\\\"\",\n      \"  restart: unless-stopped\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A compose service\"\n  },\n  \"Kubernetes deployment\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"k8s\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"apiVersion: apps/v1\",\n      \"kind: Deployment\",\n      \"metadata:\",\n      \"  name: ${1:app}\",\n      \"spec:\",\n      \"  replicas: ${2:2}\",\n      \"  selector:\",\n      \"    matchLabels:\",\n      \"      app: ${1:app}\",\n      \"  template:\",\n      \"    metadata:\",\n      \"      labels:\",\n      \"        app: ${1:app}\",\n      \"    spec:\",\n      \"      containers:\",\n      \"        - name: ${1:app}\",\n      \"          image: ${3:image:tag}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Deployment\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# YAML\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for YAML.\n\n## Files\n\n`.yaml`, `.yml`, `.clang-format`, `.gitlab-ci.yml`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `#`.\n- 3 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `gha` | A GitHub Actions workflow |\n| `dcs` | A compose service |\n| `k8s` | A Deployment |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}